1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,263
A useful trick.

2
00:00:01,263 --> 00:00:06,627
The first order equation only needs the ratio of initial to remaining amount.

3
00:00:06,627 --> 00:00:15,625
So any quantity proportional to the amount left will do: a titration volume, a gas pressure, an angle of optical rotation.

4
00:00:15,625 --> 00:00:17,031
The units cancel.

